{"additionalPlain":"Why Join Welo Data?  \n✨ Limitless Flexibility  \nProject-based opportunities that fit your availability. Choose when and how much you want to contribute—fully remote, with complete autonomy.   \n🌱 Limitless Growth  \nOptional access to AI and Large Language Model workshops designed specifically for professionals like you. No coding required—just your expertise.   \n🌍 Limitless Support  \nBe part of a global contributor community with responsive guidance and support.   \n💡 Real Impact  \nApply your expertise in the Legal field to influence the AI systems shaping the future of your industry—while collaborating with data professionals and expanding your skills.  \n \nHow to Apply? \nApply now by answering a few quick questions to join our database and become part of our growing community. \n \nAbout Welo Data \nWelo Data, part of Welocalize, is a global AI data company with 500,000+ contributors delivering high-quality, ethical data to train the world’s most advanced AI systems. We’re building smarter, more human AI with a diverse community in 100+ countries.  \nAt Welo Data, Limitless AI. Limitless You. isn’t just a slogan—it’s our promise. We build smarter AI through the power of human contribution, offering limitless opportunities for our global community to grow, contribute, and work on their terms. \n","additional":"<div>\n<div><strong>Why Join Welo Data?&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div><strong>✨ Limitless Flexibility &nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div>Project-based opportunities that fit your availability. Choose when and how much you want to contribute—fully remote, with complete autonomy. &nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\n<div>🌱<strong> Limitless Growth &nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div>Optional access to AI and Large Language Model workshops designed specifically for professionals like you. No coding required—just your expertise. &nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\n<div>🌍<strong> Limitless Support &nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div>Be part of a global contributor community with responsive guidance and support. &nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\n<div>💡<strong> Real Impact &nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div>Apply your expertise in the Legal field to influence the AI systems shaping the future of your industry—while collaborating with data professionals and expanding your skills.&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>How to Apply?&nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div>Apply now by answering a few quick questions to join our database and become part of our growing community.&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>About Welo Data&nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div>Welo Data, part of Welocalize, is a global AI data company with 500,000+ contributors delivering high-quality, ethical data to train the world’s most advanced AI systems. We’re building smarter, more human AI with a diverse community in 100+ countries.&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\n<div>At Welo Data, Limitless AI. Limitless You. isn’t just a slogan—it’s our promise. We build smarter AI through the power of human contribution, offering limitless opportunities for our global community to grow, contribute, and work on their terms.&nbsp;</div>\n</div>","categories":{"commitment":"Freelance","department":"Welo Data - AI Services","location":"Philippines","team":"AI Service General Application","allLocations":["Philippines"]},"createdAt":1787294780876,"descriptionPlain":"About the Role \nWe are looking for a detail-oriented QC Reviewer to ensure the quality and consistency of robot manipulation video annotations produced by our annotation team. You'll review labeled video segments against a detailed style guide and reference examples, catch errors or inconsistencies, and provide clear, constructive feedback to annotators. This role is critical to maintaining the accuracy and reliability of training data used for robotics AI models. \nWhat You'll Do \nReview completed annotations of robot manipulation videos across three levels of labeling detail (atomic motion, skill/subtask, task/goal). \n\n\n","description":"<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">About the Role</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">We are looking for a detail-oriented QC Reviewer to ensure the quality and consistency of robot manipulation video annotations produced by our annotation team.&nbsp;You'll&nbsp;review labeled video segments against a detailed&nbsp;style&nbsp;guide and reference examples, catch errors or inconsistencies, and provide clear, constructive feedback to annotators. This role is critical to&nbsp;maintaining&nbsp;the accuracy and reliability of training data used for robotics AI models.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">What You'll Do</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"5\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Review completed annotations of robot manipulation videos across three levels of labeling detail (atomic motion, skill/subtask, task/goal).</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"5\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Cross-check annotator descriptions against all three camera views (overhead and both wrist-mounted cameras) to verify accuracy of described actions, object identification, and contact/grasp details.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"5\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Verify full coverage of each video — confirm there are no gaps in labeling, including idle or pause moments.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"5\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Check that descriptions accurately reflect what&nbsp;actually happened&nbsp;in the video, including failures, drops, or slipped grips — flagging any instances where outcomes were inaccurately described or \"smoothed over.\"</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"5\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Evaluate annotations for adherence to the style guide: correct vocabulary usage, spatial/directional accuracy, consistent terminology for objects and actions, and&nbsp;appropriate language&nbsp;variation (avoiding repetitive phrasing).</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"5\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Identify&nbsp;recurring errors or patterns of confusion among annotators and report them to the&nbsp;team&nbsp;lead&nbsp;for calibration purposes.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"5\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Provide specific, actionable feedback on rejected or revised annotations, referencing the style guide and reference examples.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"5\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"8\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Participate in periodic calibration sessions with the team and&nbsp;client&nbsp;to align QC standards with evolving guidelines or&nbsp;edge-case&nbsp;resolutions.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"5\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"9\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Maintain a QC log or tracking sheet documenting review outcomes, common error types, and annotator performance trends (as required by the project).</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">What We're Looking For</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Required:</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Excellent written English and strong reading comprehension —&nbsp;you'll&nbsp;be evaluating precise, nuanced language choices, not just checking for typos.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Exceptional attention to detail — able to catch subtle mismatches between video content and written description (e.g., a mislabeled grasp type, an incorrect object part, a missed failure event).</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Strong grasp of spatial/mechanical description (left/right, above/below, object parts like handles, lids, edges) to verify annotator accuracy.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Ability to apply a detailed, structured style guide consistently and make sound judgment calls in ambiguous or edge-case scenarios.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Comfort giving clear, specific, and constructive feedback to annotators (written feedback, not just pass/fail marks).</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Reliable, self-directed work habits, with the ability to work independently while meeting review turnaround expectations.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Nice to Have:</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"7\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Prior experience in a QC, editing, proofreading, or annotation review role.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"7\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience with video annotation, data labeling, or transcription QA specifically.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"7\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Familiarity with robotics terminology (grippers, end-effectors, manipulation).</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"7\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience with annotation tools such as Label Studio, including review/approval workflows.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","id":"9bd19b88-42a1-4681-9625-120ea954f16c","lists":[],"salaryRange":{"min":4.03,"max":4.03,"currency":"USD","interval":"per-hour-wage"},"text":"Project Cursa - Robot Manipulation Video Annotation QC","country":"PH","workplaceType":"remote","opening":"","openingPlain":"","descriptionBody":"<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">About the Role</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">We are looking for a detail-oriented QC Reviewer to ensure the quality and consistency of robot manipulation video annotations produced by our annotation team.&nbsp;You'll&nbsp;review labeled video segments against a detailed&nbsp;style&nbsp;guide and reference examples, catch errors or inconsistencies, and provide clear, constructive feedback to annotators. This role is critical to&nbsp;maintaining&nbsp;the accuracy and reliability of training data used for robotics AI models.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">What You'll Do</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"5\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Review completed annotations of robot manipulation videos across three levels of labeling detail (atomic motion, skill/subtask, task/goal).</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"5\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Cross-check annotator descriptions against all three camera views (overhead and both wrist-mounted cameras) to verify accuracy of described actions, object identification, and contact/grasp details.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"5\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Verify full coverage of each video &mdash; confirm there are no gaps in labeling, including idle or pause moments.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"5\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Check that descriptions accurately reflect what&nbsp;actually happened&nbsp;in the video, including failures, drops, or slipped grips &mdash; flagging any instances where outcomes were inaccurately described or \"smoothed over.\"</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"5\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Evaluate annotations for adherence to the style guide: correct vocabulary usage, spatial/directional accuracy, consistent terminology for objects and actions, and&nbsp;appropriate language&nbsp;variation (avoiding repetitive phrasing).</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"5\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Identify&nbsp;recurring errors or patterns of confusion among annotators and report them to the&nbsp;team&nbsp;lead&nbsp;for calibration purposes.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"5\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Provide specific, actionable feedback on rejected or revised annotations, referencing the style guide and reference examples.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"8\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"5\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Participate in periodic calibration sessions with the team and&nbsp;client&nbsp;to align QC standards with evolving guidelines or&nbsp;edge-case&nbsp;resolutions.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"9\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"5\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Maintain a QC log or tracking sheet documenting review outcomes, common error types, and annotator performance trends (as required by the project).</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">What We're Looking For</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Required:</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"6\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Excellent written English and strong reading comprehension &mdash;&nbsp;you'll&nbsp;be evaluating precise, nuanced language choices, not just checking for typos.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"6\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Exceptional attention to detail &mdash; able to catch subtle mismatches between video content and written description (e.g., a mislabeled grasp type, an incorrect object part, a missed failure event).</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"6\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Strong grasp of spatial/mechanical description (left/right, above/below, object parts like handles, lids, edges) to verify annotator accuracy.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"6\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Ability to apply a detailed, structured style guide consistently and make sound judgment calls in ambiguous or edge-case scenarios.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"6\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Comfort giving clear, specific, and constructive feedback to annotators (written feedback, not just pass/fail marks).</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"6\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Reliable, self-directed work habits, with the ability to work independently while meeting review turnaround expectations.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Nice to Have:</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"7\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Prior experience in a QC, editing, proofreading, or annotation review role.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"7\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience with video annotation, data labeling, or transcription QA specifically.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"7\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Familiarity with robotics terminology (grippers, end-effectors, manipulation).</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"7\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience with annotation tools such as Label Studio, including review/approval workflows.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","descriptionBodyPlain":"About the Role \nWe are looking for a detail-oriented QC Reviewer to ensure the quality and consistency of robot manipulation video annotations produced by our annotation team. You'll review labeled video segments against a detailed style guide and reference examples, catch errors or inconsistencies, and provide clear, constructive feedback to annotators. This role is critical to maintaining the accuracy and reliability of training data used for robotics AI models. \nWhat You'll Do \nReview completed annotations of robot manipulation videos across three levels of labeling detail (atomic motion, skill/subtask, task/goal). \n\n\n","hostedUrl":"https://jobs.lever.co/weloglobal/9bd19b88-42a1-4681-9625-120ea954f16c","applyUrl":"https://jobs.lever.co/weloglobal/9bd19b88-42a1-4681-9625-120ea954f16c/apply"}